    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/bd74dbeeffe386899b2cdd5af62bbd38.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Spacefleet: Heat Death\u00a0</i></strong><i>is a <strong>realism-focused tactical space RPG </strong>that\u00a0combines <strong>fleet management, orbital maneuvering, station-building</strong>, and <strong>emergent faction warfare</strong> in the Earth-Luna system and its Lagrange points.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERVIEW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your old life was never perfect. There was either too much or not enough. But in orbit, you can make a name for yourself. You are now an orbital deliveryman, mercenary captain, or faction leader\u2014whatever it was you chose to be\u2014scraping by on trade contracts, doing favors, and slowly but surely building an empire that will reach the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From humble beginnings, you\u2019ll rise (or burn) in a world where politics, physics, and invisible lasers collide.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/5476de22a163d20278213d0ea1efef62.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/e1e05def70cd4bfb09d55291e2d3c359.poster.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/e1e05def70cd4bfb09d55291e2d3c359.webm?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/e1e05def70cd4bfb09d55291e2d3c359.mp4?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aside from being a great word to describe the end of the universe, in this game, &quot;Heat Death&quot; takes on a whole new meaning. Careful heat management and efficient use of power-hungry systems are vital to keeping your ship from melting and its crew from baking alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/a5adabd2fcfe3e2586c7071745870616.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/634e2ddd44c4da8aeff478a06ea68f44.poster.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/634e2ddd44c4da8aeff478a06ea68f44.webm?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/634e2ddd44c4da8aeff478a06ea68f44.mp4?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Engage in high-stakes battles with flip-and-burn maneuvers, delta-v limits, radiators, and power management. Ships don't have hitpoints; they have modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/6db78777dac17a6673905dcfaaba5612.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/beb826aeded8a9745ddee6cbe2745bc5.poster.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/beb826aeded8a9745ddee6cbe2745bc5.webm?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/beb826aeded8a9745ddee6cbe2745bc5.mp4?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use the strategic map to plan intercepts, organize convoys, or deploy fleets. Trade, smuggle, invest, gamble, or disrupt rival factions through logistics and force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/84bde531302256e2c837a498aca84914.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/7bf4748716b35b90814ff532463b9b96.poster.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/7bf4748716b35b90814ff532463b9b96.webm?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/7bf4748716b35b90814ff532463b9b96.mp4?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Start small with a single ship and a dream. Choose your path: merchant, stationeer, mercenary captain, fleet commander, or something else. Rise through the ranks with diplomacy, subterfuge, and war. Take on major factions such as the Shenzhen Interplanetary Corporation, Cascadia, and the Persian Federation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/d221055a8ff6b426db41b9a291307680.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/f5280a4d92c9f4d993b64310884ce741.poster.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/f5280a4d92c9f4d993b64310884ce741.webm?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/f5280a4d92c9f4d993b64310884ce741.mp4?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Establish stations to serve as your base of operations, inventory, industry, and income. Upgrade defenses, lay down logistics, and carve out a piece of Earth orbit for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/f30d1f878bd8a82d382daa6d64bfa989.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/1c1393ec53802d08e128d2fad64dd270.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=150 /></span>From Earth\u2019s ruined nations to orbital megacorps and ideologue enclaves, every faction has its own goals, strengths, and weaknesses. Form alliances\u2014or shatter them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/77bb36168a9f1ebbcabf5860c07b7910.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/bfa42ef2e34fec5701466ec24813f0bb.poster.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/bfa42ef2e34fec5701466ec24813f0bb.webm?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/bfa42ef2e34fec5701466ec24813f0bb.mp4?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Rocket science and orbital maneuvers don't have to be hard! Learn the basics in minutes, then dive deep into orbital tactics, heat sinks, and power distribution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROOF-OF-CONCEPT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spacefleet: Heat Death</strong> is a proof-of-concept \u201clite\u201d version of a much larger game, <strong>Spacefleet:</strong><i>\u00a0</i><strong>Sol</strong>, which will span the entire solar system and have more core features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By buying <strong>Heat Death</strong>, you're supporting the development of <strong>Sol</strong>, and helping shape its foundation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free demo for <strong>Heat Death\u00a0</strong>is also available. Once <strong>Sol</strong> releases, <strong>Heat Death\u00a0</strong>will become <strong>free-to-play</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/bd74dbeeffe386899b2cdd5af62bbd38.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Spacefleet: Heat Death\u00a0</i></strong><i>is a <strong>realism-focused tactical space RPG </strong>that\u00a0combines <strong>fleet management, orbital maneuvering, station-building</strong>, and <strong>emergent faction warfare</strong> in the Earth-Luna system and its Lagrange points.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERVIEW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your old life was never perfect. There was either too much or not enough. But in orbit, you can make a name for yourself. You are now an orbital deliveryman, mercenary captain, or faction leader\u2014whatever it was you chose to be\u2014scraping by on trade contracts, doing favors, and slowly but surely building an empire that will reach the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From humble beginnings, you\u2019ll rise (or burn) in a world where politics, physics, and invisible lasers collide.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/5476de22a163d20278213d0ea1efef62.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/e1e05def70cd4bfb09d55291e2d3c359.poster.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/e1e05def70cd4bfb09d55291e2d3c359.webm?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/e1e05def70cd4bfb09d55291e2d3c359.mp4?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aside from being a great word to describe the end of the universe, in this game, &quot;Heat Death&quot; takes on a whole new meaning. Careful heat management and efficient use of power-hungry systems are vital to keeping your ship from melting and its crew from baking alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/a5adabd2fcfe3e2586c7071745870616.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/634e2ddd44c4da8aeff478a06ea68f44.poster.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/634e2ddd44c4da8aeff478a06ea68f44.webm?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/634e2ddd44c4da8aeff478a06ea68f44.mp4?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Engage in high-stakes battles with flip-and-burn maneuvers, delta-v limits, radiators, and power management. Ships don't have hitpoints; they have modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/6db78777dac17a6673905dcfaaba5612.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/beb826aeded8a9745ddee6cbe2745bc5.poster.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/beb826aeded8a9745ddee6cbe2745bc5.webm?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/beb826aeded8a9745ddee6cbe2745bc5.mp4?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use the strategic map to plan intercepts, organize convoys, or deploy fleets. Trade, smuggle, invest, gamble, or disrupt rival factions through logistics and force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/84bde531302256e2c837a498aca84914.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/7bf4748716b35b90814ff532463b9b96.poster.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/7bf4748716b35b90814ff532463b9b96.webm?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/7bf4748716b35b90814ff532463b9b96.mp4?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Start small with a single ship and a dream. Choose your path: merchant, stationeer, mercenary captain, fleet commander, or something else. Rise through the ranks with diplomacy, subterfuge, and war. Take on major factions such as the Shenzhen Interplanetary Corporation, Cascadia, and the Persian Federation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/d221055a8ff6b426db41b9a291307680.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/f5280a4d92c9f4d993b64310884ce741.poster.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/f5280a4d92c9f4d993b64310884ce741.webm?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/f5280a4d92c9f4d993b64310884ce741.mp4?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Establish stations to serve as your base of operations, inventory, industry, and income. Upgrade defenses, lay down logistics, and carve out a piece of Earth orbit for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/f30d1f878bd8a82d382daa6d64bfa989.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/1c1393ec53802d08e128d2fad64dd270.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=150 /></span>From Earth\u2019s ruined nations to orbital megacorps and ideologue enclaves, every faction has its own goals, strengths, and weaknesses. Form alliances\u2014or shatter them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/77bb36168a9f1ebbcabf5860c07b7910.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/bfa42ef2e34fec5701466ec24813f0bb.poster.avif?t=1755278910\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/bfa42ef2e34fec5701466ec24813f0bb.webm?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854580/extras/bfa42ef2e34fec5701466ec24813f0bb.mp4?t=1755278910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Rocket science and orbital maneuvers don't have to be hard! Learn the basics in minutes, then dive deep into orbital tactics, heat sinks, and power distribution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROOF-OF-CONCEPT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spacefleet: Heat Death</strong> is a proof-of-concept \u201clite\u201d version of a much larger game, <strong>Spacefleet:</strong><i>\u00a0</i><strong>Sol</strong>, which will span the entire solar system and have more core features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By buying <strong>Heat Death</strong>, you're supporting the development of <strong>Sol</strong>, and helping shape its foundation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free demo for <strong>Heat Death\u00a0</strong>is also available. Once <strong>Sol</strong> releases, <strong>Heat Death\u00a0</strong>will become <strong>free-to-play</strong>!</p>",
    "short_description": "In the 23rd century, Earth orbit is flooded with debris from constant warfare. Countries, megacorporations, and mercenaries are fighting for control.\u00a0Take contracts, build your warfleets, and dominate the Earth-Luna system in this realism-focused strategy RPG!",
